      "dom_id": "step-q221408",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Let $a$ and $b$ be integers and let $q$ be a prime number. If $q∣ab,$ then{{field-1}} \nor\n{{field-2}}",
      "worked_solution": "For any integers $a$ and $b$ and any prime $q,$ we have that\n\n$$\nq∣ab\\,⟹\\,q∣a\\,\\text{or}\\,q∣b.\n$$",
