      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "Let $m$ and $n$ be integers and let $p$ be a prime number. If $p∣mn,$ then\n$p∣m$\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}",
      "worked_solution": "For any integers $m$ and $n$ and any prime $p,$ we have that\n\n$$\np∣mn\\,⟹\\,p∣m\\,\\text{or}\\,p∣n.\n$$",
